Q: Foreach loop problem in model using Codeigniter A: <p>You could get it done (getting names list) by directly using <code>join()</code> method like this :  </p>

<pre><code>public function fetch_emp() 
{ 
$this-&gt;db-&gt;select('emp_name');
$this-&gt;db-&gt;from('emp');
$this-&gt;db-&gt;join('employee_master', 'employee_master.emp_id = emp.emp_id');
$res=$this-&gt;db-&gt;get();
    return $res-&gt;result();
}
</code></pre>

