Q: Codeigniter3: How to get error or success info from db-&gt;insert? A: <p><code>$this-&gt;db-&gt;_error_message()</code> is deprecated so instead of that try use following function.</p>

<pre><code>$error = $this-&gt;db-&gt;error(); 
</code></pre>
